<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WellPoint Health cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WellPoint Health cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Tuesday it cut its rating for WellPoint Health Networks Inc to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Woodland Hills, Calif., managed health care company fell 1-7/8 to 45-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
